.
.  Generate sample output for Power Lognormal PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na plnpdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Power Lognormal PDF (P = 2)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT PLNPDF(X,2) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 4
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv plnpdf.jpg ../gif100/plnpdf.jpg
.
quit
